│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ short_lookback_zscore_regime                                                              │
│ patch_description        │ The current model suffers from severe slope collapse (0.074 train → 0.006 val) indicating │
│                          │ regime-specific overfitting. Key parameter changes:                                       │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. **Shorter lookback windows**: Reduced from 60-200 bars to 3-20 bars maximum. Features  │
│                          │ decay faster but generalize better across regime shifts.                                  │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 2. **Rolling z-score normalization**: All momentum and volatility features are z-scored   │
│                          │ within 20-bar windows, making them regime-invariant. A 1% move in low-vol vs high-vol     │
│                          │ regimes now has comparable feature values.                                                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 3. **Rate-of-change features**: Added vol_trend, autocorr_trend, efficiency_trend to      │
│                          │ capture HOW market character is changing rather than absolute levels.                     │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 4. **Reduced model complexity**: n_estimators 400→250, increased min_child_weight 1→3,    │
│                          │ added reg_lambda=1.0 to force learning only robust patterns with high sample support.     │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 5. **Feature interaction**: momentum × vol_regime as single multiplicative term           │
│                          │ generalizes better than separate features.                                                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 6. **Removed long-term features**: Eliminated 60+ bar lookbacks, 200-bar rolling ranks,   │
│                          │ and other features that encode specific regime characteristics.                           │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Target: val_slope >= 0.020 (currently 0.006), val_DA >= 0.525 (currently 0.511),          │
│                          │ pred_std_ratio >= 0.18 (currently 0.112)                                                  │
